 "notes": "Weakest calendar of the eight Southern Union conferences: dates sit inside flyer images on the event pages, there is no calendar view, no feed and no year plan, and the homepage youth link (mcsyouth.com) points to a parked domain for sale. What is visible shows a strong health/disability-inclusion emphasis (I'm Involved retreats, disability holiday social, Journey to Wholeness addiction-recovery training with Florida Conference, wellness weeks of prayer in schools), Haitian and Hispanic tracks (Haitian Leadership Summit, Haitian camp with first health expo, Campestre Hispano, Hispanic discipleship conference), and a Personal Ministries regional Bible-worker training series ('Equipped 2 Win'). The 2027 Women's Ministries retreat 'Loved and Chosen' (23-25 Apr 2027, Embassy Suites Orlando-Lake Buena Vista South) is published but falls outside the window. No youth, Pathfinder or Adventurer events could be found in public sources for the window. News-derived items use the event date stated in the article; where an article gives only a month, datePrecision is 'month'."
